TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_62DC_51FF';
<p>62dc_51ff</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #6d5d10;">Gene D</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #6d5d10;"><i>dewy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #6d5d10;">Gene D</span> appears moist, with its body covered in tiny droplets of water.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #0a6788;">Gene E</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #0a6788;"><i>eery</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #0a6788;">Gene E</span> appears to have something off, crooked limbs and other twisted appendages.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #9f2d4d;">Gene X</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #9f2d4d;"><i>xanthic</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #9f2d4d;">Gene X</span> has a fluorescent bright yellow coloring.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, eery, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f5ecb8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d8eeff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">206</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f5ecb8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d8eeff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9f2d4d;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">68</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f5ecb8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0a6788;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f5ecb8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0a6788;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9f2d4d;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">605</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6d5d10;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d8eeff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">628</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6d5d10;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d8eeff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9f2d4d;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6d5d10;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0a6788;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">49</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6d5d10;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0a6788;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9f2d4d;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">235</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,800</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the <span style="color: DarkBlue;"><strong>all recombinant genotypes</strong></span> for genes <b>D</b> and <b>E</b>. These genotypes result from crossover events that occur between the two genes <b>D</b> and <b>E</b> during meiosis.</p> <p>More than one genotype will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_62DC_51FF
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_1';
dex
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_2';
de+
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_3';
d+x
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_4';
d++
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_5';
+ex
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_6';
+e+
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_6
$choice_7 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_7';
++x
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_7
$choice_8 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_8';
+++
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CHOICE_8
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CORRECT_1';
dex
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CORRECT_1
$correct_2 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CORRECT_2';
de+
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CORRECT_2
$correct_3 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CORRECT_3';
++x
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CORRECT_3
$correct_4 = <<'LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CORRECT_4';
+++
LITERAL_62DC_51FF_CORRECT_4
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6, $choice_7, $choice_8);
@correct = ($correct_1, $correct_2, $correct_3, $correct_4);
$answer = CheckboxList([@choices], [@correct], labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
